@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001

### Register Sensor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/register-sensor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "00:1A:2B:3C:4D:5E",
  "locationZone": "Zone 1",
  "category": "Environmental",
  "description": "Soil moisture sensor for hydroponics"
}

### Ingest Telemetry - Normal Power Reading
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "00:1A:2B:3C:4D:5E",
  "locationZone": "Zone 1",
  "category": "Power Consumption",
  "sensorValue": 5000,
  "timestamp": "2026-09-12T10:30:00"
}

### Ingest Telemetry - Power Surge (High Severity)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "00:1A:2B:3C:4D:5E",
  "locationZone": "Zone 1",
  "category": "Power Consumption",
  "sensorValue": 9850,
  "timestamp": "2026-09-12T10:35:00"
}

### Ingest Telemetry - Low Moisture (High Severity)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF",
  "locationZone": "Sub-Zone B",
  "category": "Environmental",
  "sensorValue": 15.5,
  "timestamp": "2026-09-12T10:40:00"
}

### Ingest Telemetry - Moderate Moisture (Medium Severity)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "macAddress": "AA:BB:CC:DD:EE:FF",
  "locationZone": "Sub-Zone B",
  "category": "Environmental",
  "sensorValue": 32.0,
  "timestamp": "2026-09-12T10:45:00"
}

### Get Telemetry History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/history/00:1A:2B:3C:4D:5E

### Get All Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/alerts

### Get All Registered Sensors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/telemetry/sensors
